### Verification trail — three independent checks

1. **OpenRouter OpenAI catalog** `https://openrouter.ai/openai`: gpt-oss entries are `openai/gpt-oss-120b`, `openai/gpt-oss-20b`, `openai/gpt-oss-safeguard-20b`. No `gpt-oss-120b-lite`. Source: OpenRouter model index page 2026-10-25.
2. **Hugging Face model search** `https://huggingface.co/models?search=gpt-oss-120b-lite`: 0 results — "No results found." Direct repo paths `openai/gpt-oss-120b-lite` return 401/not found. Source: Hugging Face search page 2026-10-25.
3. **Artificial Analysis** `https://artificialanalysis.ai/models/gpt-oss-120b-lite`: 404. Source: Artificial Analysis URL test 2026-10-25.

Conflict / resolution: all three agree independently that nothing exists under this name. No conflicting sources found.

Closest real models: `gpt-oss-120b` (real 117B-class open-weights flagship, 131,072 ctx) and `gpt-oss-20b` (the genuinely smaller real sibling). Research for those belongs in `model/gpt-oss-120b/` and `model/gpt-oss-20b/`.

